MID_MV12_02: <SH>
MID_MV12_02_m001: *grunt*
MID_MV12_02_m002: *gasp*
MID_MV12_02_m003: (sea beast roar)
MID_MV12_02_m004: *gasp*
MID_MV12_02_m005: *effort*\n*small effort*
MID_MV12_02_m006: Non toccarla!
MID_MV12_02_m007: Se una persona qualunque la tocca...
MID_MV12_02_m008: *concerned/interested react*
MID_MV12_02_m009: (rushing in)
MID_MV12_02_m010: *two-beat react to pulling sword from ground*
MID_MV12_02_m011: *tiny surprise react*\n*intrigued react*
MID_MV12_02_m012: La reliquia sta reagendo...
MID_MV12_02_m013: Questa semplice paesana può\nbrandire una reliquia degli eroi?
MID_MV12_02_m014: Ehi, tu!
MID_MV12_02_m015: *grunt*
MID_MV12_02_m016: Rrrah...
MID_MV12_02_m017: Aaah!
MID_MV12_02_m018: *small react for jump*
MID_MV12_02_m019: *large sword slash downward*